#: ../../pyvista/CONTRIBUTING.rst:2288
msgid "Linux Runners"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pyvista/CONTRIBUTING.rst:2289
msgid ""
"PyVista uses a high availability Linux cluster running "
"[k3s](https://k3s.io/) and deployed using "
"[Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/). See [pyvista/arc-"
"runners](https://github.com/pyvista/arc-runners) for more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pyvista/CONTRIBUTING.rst:2293
msgid ""
"GPU enabled runs should use the ``ubuntu-24.04-self-hosted-gpu`` labels. "
"Runners using this label will receive a minimum of 2 CPUs and at maximum 8 "
"CPUs along with access to either an NVIDIA Quadro P2000 or a NVIDIA T400 "
"(4GB VRAM)."
msgstr ""
